    Westerham\n\nTeagan Simoneau\n\nXiaoyu Luo\n\nProject Advisor:\n\nDr. Benjamin
    Philmus (Sponsor and Curriculum Advisor)\n\nSpecial Thanks To:\n\nStrato (TA)\n\nKirsten
    Winters (CS46X Instructor)\n\nAlex Ulbrich (CS46X Instructor)\n\nOregon State
    University, College of Pharmacy\n\nAll PharmD students who participated in Alpha
    and Beta testing and provided valuable feedback."
